# Web data fetching

- `QueryClient` is created once in `src/lib/query-client.ts`.
- Feature hooks call `apiClient`; components do not call `fetch`.
- Query keys come from `src/lib/query-keys.ts`.
- Type payloads with `@supplyeagle/types`.
- Routes live in React Router (`App.tsx`). Do not fetch from the API in route loaders.
- The web app talks only to `@supplyeagle/api` through `/api`.
